SUMMARY:Phil's Hills: Mt Gretna Repeats
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader:** Phil New
 swanger\n\n**Phil’s Hills**: a series of structured hill repeat rides de
 signed to build strength\, endurance and boost your overall fitness.\n\n**
 Route link:** [Phil's Hills: Mt Gretna Repeats](https://ridewithgps.com/ro
 utes/53981920)\n**PDF link:** [Cuesheet](https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.co
 m/assets.modomadethis.com/cuesheets/Phils_Hills_Mt_Gretna_Repeats.pdf)\n\n
 What to Expect:\n\n* **Route:** Expect a total distance of approximately *
 *15-20 miles**\, including **3-4 loops** of a circuit featuring **1-2 clim
 bing segment**.\n* **Focus:** We'll emphasize maintaining a consistent cli
 mbing tempo\, active recovery between efforts\, and repeating the effort t
 o build power and efficiency.\n* **Pace:** We'll maintain a comfortable av
 erage pace range of **14-16 mph**.\n* **No-Drop Policy:** You'll never be 
 left behind! We'll regroup after climbs to ensure everyone stays together.
 \n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds or audible music-playin
 g devices. Please bring water\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire 
 levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).
